      "side": 1,
      "message": "Operation through vendor hook is just saving the input events to the buffer like evdev client. Actual operation of booster module is performed in other context through kworkers. So I thought it could be placed in the spinlock section.\n\nCould you please make sure that placing \"vendor hook\" in spinlock section with irq disabled could be a problem?\nI wonder if what you talked about is the location of \"Vendor Hook\" or the logic in the vendor hook.",
